# Environment variables the lab reads. Nothing loads a .env file automatically: set them in
# your shell (see README) before running. ALL keys are optional:
# with none set, the lab uses the free keyless Pollinations endpoint (gpt-oss-20b).
# Backend priority: OpenAI-compatible -> Groq -> Google Gemini -> Pollinations (keyless).

# --- OpenAI or any OpenAI-compatible server (Ollama, LM Studio, OpenRouter, ...) ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=
# OPENAI_MODEL=

# --- Groq (free tier: https://console.groq.com) ---
# GROQ_API_KEY=

# --- Google Gemini (free tier: https://aistudio.google.com) ---
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY is accepted as an alias
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# --- Experiment 1: where the memory server stores notes (default: notes.json) ---
# NOTES_FILE=

# --- MCP servers: log verbosity on stderr (default WARNING; INFO shows every request) ---
# LOG_LEVEL=INFO
